{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115614","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115614/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115614/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115614/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115614","id":3873435493,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7m3-9l","number":115614,"title":"EditorNode::update_node_reference  method is not protected against infinite recursion, causing crashes","user":{"login":"LBdN","id":138711,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODcxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138711?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN","html_url":"https://github.com/LBdN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LBdN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-30T01:55:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T11:04:17Z","closed_at":"2026-03-19T10:25:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nbug on v4.6.stable.mono.official [89cea1439]\nit is a regression from 4.5.1 official.  \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8132) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 95.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEditor crash.\nEditorNode::update_node_reference calls EditorNode::gather_resources, but gather_resources is not protected against recursive references ( A referencing B, and B referencing A, both having export decorators ) and in this case,  this eventually crashes the editor. \n\nIn the example below, _connected_to_ is assigned at runtime and the value of _connected_to_ in Port A is  Port B, and vice versa. \nremoving the @export removes the crash, but there is no way to understand the cause without looking at the cpp code. \n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. create 2 resources with one empty exported attribute.\n2. make those resources part of a node3d. \n3. post-load via script, fill the attribute of each with the other\n4. select the node3d in the editor\n5. crash\n\n\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\n@tool\nextends Resource\n\nclass_name Graph\n\n@export port_A : Port\n@export port_B : Port\n\n@export_storage var exit_node_id : int :\n    set(_value):\n        exit_node_id = _value\n        post_load()\n\nfunc post_load():    \n        port_A.connected_to = port_B       \n        port_B.connected_to = port_A\n```\n    \n\n```\n@tool\nextends Resource\n\nclass_name Port\n\n@export var connected_to : Port = null \n@export_storage var connected_to_id : int = 0\n```","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"